# SOURCE_DATE: 2006-06-01
# SOURCE_TABLE: Table 1b, BabelColor Avg. columns, patches 13-18
# DATA: Lab derived from averaged measured spectra of 20 ColorChecker charts
# ILLUMINANT: D50
# WARNING: Color reference chart measurements, NOT factory yarn measurements.
# WARNING: Not D65/10 degree data. No conversion has been applied.
# No stock, price, material, dtex or bobbin values are supplied.

